<title>USA: Lomak Petroleum Inc seeks NYSE listing.</title>
<headline>Lomak Petroleum Inc seeks NYSE listing.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lomak Petroleum Inc said Tuesday it has applied for for listing on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>It is expected that Lomak's common shares will begin trading on the exchange within 30 days, the company said.</p>
<p>Lomak President John Pinkerton said in a statement that the listing should improve the liquidity of the company's shares and reduce the cost of trading them.</p>
<p>Lomak's stock now trades on the Nasdaq system.</p>
</text>
